# B-663 regression: @Dict annotation must produce an open-record type, not a record
# whose field names are TypeNode constructor names (Int, String, Float, Proxy, etc.).
# Before the fix, the TypeNode constructor dict leaked into the type annotation,
# causing false "missing field 'Proxy'" errors on Dict-annotated values.
[
  xs@Dict: [a: 1  b: 2]
  xs
]
=== out
{0: {a: Int(1), b: Int(2)}}
